---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const navItems = [
  { href: '#protocol', label: t('实验边界', 'Protocol') },
  { href: '#questions', label: t('七个问题', 'Seven questions') },
  { href: '#g2-ablation', label: t('第二代更新', 'G2 ablation') },
  { href: '#next-steps', label: t('下一步', 'Next steps') },
  { href: '#appendix', label: t('历史记录', 'History') },
] as const;
---

<header class="results-hero">
  <div class="results-first-screen">
  <h1>{t('OpenEvo × WebShop 研究结果', 'OpenEvo × WebShop research findings')}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{t(
    '这组结果分别回答单次更新后的内部迁移、多代持续整合与正式基准比较；三者不能互相替代。',
    'These results separate transfer after one update, multi-generation integration, and benchmark comparison; none can stand in for another.',
  )}</p>

  <section class="results-primary" aria-label={t('已知结果、最新评估与当前下一步', 'What is known, the latest evaluation, and the current next step')} data-testid="results-first-screen-answers">
    <p class="primary-answer" data-result-answer="learned"><strong>{t('已经学到', 'What we know')}</strong><span>{t(
      '两次独立的一步更新实验都观察到内部未见任务迁移，支持一次更新后可以迁移；这不证明多代持续提升，也不是官方保留任务上的方法比较。',
      'Two independent one-update experiments observed transfer to unseen internal tasks. This supports transfer after one update, not stable multi-generation gains or a method comparison on the official held-out tasks.',
    )}</span></p>
    <p class="primary-answer" data-result-answer="latest"><strong>{t('最新配对测量', 'Latest paired measurement')}</strong><span>{t(
      '纠错后的源代码忠实 128 题配对测量已完成，两臂任务都有效，但完整成功数相同，任务分差值的 95% 范围仍包含零；稳定优势尚未建立。',
      'The corrected source-faithful paired 128-task measurement is complete and both arms are valid, but exact successes are tied and the 95% range for the score difference still includes zero; a stable advantage is not established.',
    )}</span></p>
    <p class="primary-answer" data-result-answer="next"><strong>{t('当前下一步', 'Current next step')}</strong><span>{t(
      '后续五项研究已预注册并获执行目标授权；精确状态、运行与资源核验及 activation receipt 仍待完成。正式任务尚未解锁，当前没有新结果。',
      'Five follow-on studies are preregistered and their scientific goal is owner-authorized; exact identities, zero-formal runtime/resource checks, and an activation receipt remain pending. Formal tasks are still locked, so there is no new result yet.',
    )}</span></p>
    <a class="primary-evidence" href="#evidence-q7">{t('查看配对测量与当前计划依据 ↓', 'Open measurement evidence and the current plan ↓')}</a>
  </section>
  </div>

  <details class="progress-detail">
    <summary>{t('展开完整进度：已经知道 / 最新评测 / 接下来', 'Open full progress: known / latest evaluation / next')}</summary>
    <div class="abstract-box" aria-label={t('30 秒进度摘要', '30-second progress summary')}>
      <div class="abstract-row">
        <span class="abstract-label established">{t('已经知道', 'What we know')}</span>
        <div class="abstract-copy">
          <p class="plain">{t(
            '模型从自己做成功的任务里学习一次以后，面对训练时没见过的新任务，表现确实可以变好；而且这个现象后来又复现了一次。',
            'After one update from its own successful trajectories, the model can perform better on tasks it did not see during training, and that effect was reproduced independently.',
          )}</p>
          <p class="detail">{t(
            '这个结论来自两次独立的一步更新实验：两次都从训练范围里挑出训练过程中没有出现过的任务。它支持“一次学习后可以迁移到未见任务”，但这些任务不是 SEED 留作正式验证的 0–499 号任务，也不能证明连续很多轮都会越来越好。',
            'This conclusion comes from two independent one-update experiments, both using tasks from the training range that were not seen during training. It supports transfer after one update, but these are not SEED’s reserved 0–499 validation tasks and it does not establish continual improvement across many updates.',
          )}</p>
          <a class="abstract-evidence" href="#evidence-q4">{t('查看这条结论的实验依据 ↓', 'Open the evidence for this claim ↓')}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="abstract-row">
        <span class="abstract-label latest">{t('最新评测', 'Latest evaluation')}</span>
        <div class="abstract-copy">
          <p class="plain">{t(
            '按照纠错后的 SEED 公开代码任务语义，同一 128 个任务已经先给基础模型做一遍，再给加载 OpenEvo 学习结果后的模型做一遍，共 256 个任务回合。OpenEvo 的平均完成度高一点，但完整成功率和基础模型一样，而且统计范围仍然包含“没有差异”，所以仍然不能说它稳定更好。',
            'Using the corrected task semantics recoverable from released SEED code, the same 128 tasks were run once with the base model and once with the same model plus the OpenEvo learning result, for 256 episodes total. Mean task progress is somewhat higher with OpenEvo, but exact success is tied and the uncertainty range still includes no difference, so a stable advantage is not established.',
          )}</p>
          <p class="detail">{t(
            '这 128 个任务先按 SEED 公开代码逐题核对，128/128 都确认一致；随后基础模型和加载冻结 OpenEvo 适配器后的模型各做一遍，256 个任务回合全部有效。OpenEvo 的平均任务完成度方向更高，但统计范围仍包含“没有差异”；原始回合、分析和运行记录都已发布，精确数字放在下方对应实验依据里。',
            'The 128 tasks were first checked one by one against the released SEED code and all 128 matched. The base model and the same model with the frozen OpenEvo adapter then each ran the panel, producing 256 valid episodes. Mean task progress was directionally higher with OpenEvo, but the uncertainty range still includes no difference. Raw episodes, analysis, and run records are published below.',
          )}</p>
          <a class="abstract-evidence" href="#evidence-q7">{t('查看这轮 128 题评测的机器证据 ↓', 'Open machine evidence for this 128-task evaluation ↓')}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="abstract-row">
        <span class="abstract-label bottleneck">{t('接下来', 'What remains')}</span>
        <div class="abstract-copy">
          <p class="plain">{t(
            '2026-09-28 冻结了五项后续研究计划，覆盖 β 更新幅度、行为与点击选择不确定性、状态容量、Task Vector 因果干预和完整 SEED-style Stage2。它们回答尚未解决的问题，但计划不等于已经执行。',
            'On 2026-09-28, five follow-on studies were frozen: update magnitude, behavior and click-choice uncertainty, state capacity, causal Task Vector intervention, and full SEED-style Stage 2. They target unanswered questions; the plan is not evidence that the work ran.',
          )}</p>
          <p class="detail">{t(
            '执行门仍为 PENDING_ZERO_FORMAL_PREFLIGHT：先核实可复用状态身份和 β 语义，再完成不消耗正式任务的 runtime、GPU、存储及 launcher 核验，并提交绑定 exact SHA 的 activation receipt。没有 receipt 前不得写成“运行中”；final panel 继续锁定。',
            'The execution gate remains PENDING_ZERO_FORMAL_PREFLIGHT: resolve reusable state identities and beta semantics, then pass zero-formal runtime, GPU, storage, and launcher checks before publishing an activation receipt bound to an exact SHA. Do not call the work running before that receipt; the final panel remains locked.',
          )}</p>
          <a class="abstract-evidence" href="#next-n2">{t('查看当前执行状态与来源 ↓', 'Open the current execution state and sources ↓')}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <div class="cutoff-note">
    <strong>{t('证据时间边界', 'Evidence cutoff')}</strong>
    <span>{t(
      '机制结论以 8 月 21 日完成的 H1.41 实验为截止点。8 月 25 日的动作读取修复、8 月 26 日的任务构建复查和后续配对测量属于更晚证据；9 月 28 日冻结的后续计划尚未执行，不会倒回去改写早期机制结论。',
      'Mechanism conclusions are cut off at H1.41, completed on August 21. The August 25 action-reading repair, August 26 task-construction audit, and later paired measurement are newer evidence; the September 28 follow-on plan has not run and does not rewrite the earlier mechanism conclusion.',
    )}</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('研究结果导航', 'Research results navigation')}>
    {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
  </nav>
</header>

<style>
  .results-hero{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 24px 12px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .results-hero h1{margin:0;max-width:940px;font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.6vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em}
  .lede{max-width:800px;margin:12px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5}
  .results-primary{max-width:820px;margin-top:14px;padding:10px 0;border-block:2px solid var(--color-text)}
  .primary-answer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:132px minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px;align-items:baseline;margin:0;padding:9px 0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5}
  .primary-answer+.primary-answer{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .primary-answer strong{font-size:1rem;font-weight:760;color:var(--color-accent)}
  .primary-answer span{color:var(--color-text)}
  .primary-evidence{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.9rem;font-weight:780;text-decoration:none}.primary-evidence:hover,.primary-evidence:focus-visible{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .progress-detail{max-width:960px;margin-top:20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .progress-detail>summary{padding:12px 0;cursor:pointer;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:720}
  .abstract-box{max-width:960px;margin-top:4px;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .abstract-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:18px 0}
  .abstract-row+.abstract-row{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .abstract-label{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.7}
  .abstract-label.established{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .abstract-label.latest{color:var(--color-info)}
  .abstract-label.bottleneck{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .abstract-copy{display:grid;gap:8px}
  .abstract-copy p{margin:0;max-width:76ch;line-height:1.72}
  .abstract-copy .plain{font-size:.94rem;color:var(--color-text)}
  .abstract-copy .detail{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.82rem}
  .abstract-evidence{justify-self:start;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:760;text-decoration:none}.abstract-evidence:hover,.abstract-evidence:focus-visible{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
  .cutoff-note{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:960px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.8rem}
  .cutoff-note strong{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .cutoff-note span{max-width:80ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1.3rem;max-width:960px;margin-top:22px;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .paper-nav a{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:720;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:.2em}
  .paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .results-hero{padding:18px 18px 8px}
    .results-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,8vw,2.5rem)}
    .primary-answer{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px;padding:7px 0}
    .abstract-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}
  }
</style>
